    <string name="privacy_policy_content">Welcome to FreshID! We take your privacy protection very seriously.\n\n1. Information Collection: We only collect necessary recognition records and user information to provide a better service experience.\n\n2. Image Processing: Photos you take or select are stored locally on your device and will not be uploaded to any server without your consent.\n\n3. Data Security: We use encryption technology to protect your data security and ensure your information is not leaked.\n\n4. User Rights: You can view, edit, or delete your personal information and recognition records at any time.\n\n5. Update Notification: We may update the privacy policy and will notify you of significant changes.\n\nThank you for trusting FreshID!</string>
